== Legal Inox that the LLVM backend does not lower yet: a Const whose value is
== an expression. Before v3.27 the section scanner recorded only the first token,
== so `K` silently became 5 instead of 6. The value is now left unresolved and
== the backend reports the gap. When Const expressions are lowered, move this
== program to tests/runtime with the output 6.
Module Diagnostics.BackendGapConstExpression

Const K := 5 + 1

Main :
    PutLn(K)
;
